  m_text: "\t<b>Deploy Cards</b>\r\n\t\t1. Place cards from your hand onto the battlefield.\n\t\t2.
    Cards can only be placed in the highlighted tiles.\n\t\t3. You can either:\n\t\t\ta.
    Deploy a card as a Character (using its character side).\n\t\t\tb. Rotate a card
    to use its Power Side and deploy it as a \n\t\t\tPower Card, enhancing your strategy.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
