  m_text: "\t<b>Attack Enemies</b> \n\t\ta. Use your characters to attack the opponent\u2019s
    characters or tower.\n\t\tb. Click a character to view its attack range.\n\t\tc.
    Each character can attack once per round.\n\t\td. Attacks must be within the
    character\u2019s range.\n\t\te. Target your opponent\u2019s tower to work toward
    victory!"
